      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/welda_kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Welda’s first depot opened in 1880, burned twice—once around 1900 and again in 1923—before the depot closed in the 1990s and moved to Topeka’s Great Overland Station Museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
